       CBL THREAD,DLL
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       CLASS-ID. Counter INHERITS Base.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       REPOSITORY.
           CLASS Base IS "java.lang.Object"
           CLASS Counter IS "com.example.Counter".
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       FACTORY.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  MADE PIC S9(9) BINARY VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       METHOD-ID. "make".
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  MADE-ONE USAGE OBJECT REFERENCE Counter.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION RETURNING MADE-ONE.
           INVOKE Counter NEW RETURNING MADE-ONE
           ADD 1 TO MADE.
       END METHOD "make".
       END FACTORY.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       OBJECT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  TOTAL PIC S9(9) BINARY VALUE 0.
       01  NEXT-ONE USAGE OBJECT REFERENCE Counter.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       METHOD-ID. "add".
       DATA DIVISION.
       LOCAL-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  STEP PIC 9 VALUE 1.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  AMOUNT PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
       01  RESULT PIC S9(9) BINARY.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BY VALUE AMOUNT RETURNING RESULT.
           ADD AMOUNT STEP TO TOTAL
           IF NEXT-ONE NOT = NULL
               INVOKE NEXT-ONE "add" USING BY VALUE AMOUNT
                   RETURNING RESULT
           END-IF
           MOVE TOTAL TO RESULT
           EXIT METHOD.
       END METHOD "add".
       END OBJECT.
       END CLASS Counter.
